# Lenny Growth Assistant rules

- Do not silently change API, streaming, or DB schemas. Update the matching doc in the same PR.
- Prefer the prioritization order in AGENTS.md over UI polish.
- Never commit `.env`, API keys, or `data/lennys-podcast-transcripts/`.
- Generated HTML must never use `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` in the parent app; use sandboxed iframe only.
- Keep generation and embedding providers separate.
- Corpus source is ChatPRD/lennys-podcast-transcripts only.
